# Branching

```
main ← dev ← feat/* | fix/* | chore/*
```

- Cut every new branch from **`dev`**, never from `main`.
- Open every PR against **`dev`**. Never target `main` with a feature, fix, chore, or Cursor agent PR.
- **`main` only receives merges from `dev`.** No direct merges of any other branch into `main`.
- After work lands on `dev`, promote to production with a `dev` → `main` merge (or PR).
